WEBVTT

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:36.860 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.980 line:0%
[Episode 39]

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:41.390 line:0%
Indeed.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:44.080 line:0%
This is much more interesting.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:46.800 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.110 line:0%
In the imperial court,

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:49.870 line:0%
you dare to act recklessly,

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.640 line:0%
showing utter disregard for the law.

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:53.360 line:0%
You're unworthy of being a subject.

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:54.890 line:0%
If the emperor doesn't act,

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:56.750 line:0%
the realm will be in turmoil.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:58.670 line:0%
Lord Lai

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:00.590 line:0%
serves the country wholeheartedly.

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:01.920 line:0%
If injustice prevails,

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.750 line:0%
we won't accept it.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.840 line:0%
It would be ungrateful and disloyal.

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:07.920 line:0%
You treacherous rebels!

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.779 line:0%
How dare you spout such nonsense!

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:11.510 line:0%
A hen crowing like a rooster,

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:13.770 line:0%
that's the real disaster for Cang State.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:19.960 line:0%
Well, well.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.830 line:0%
you've all come out now.

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.160 line:0%
Then I'd like to see

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:25.390 line:0%
just who exactly

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:27.640 line:0%
is this disaster for Cang State.

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:29.080 line:0%
Guards!

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.480 line:0%
Why don't you let me try?

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.160 line:0%
Guards!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.270 line:0%
Take a look.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.430 line:0%
This is our Cang State's

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.640 line:0%
Qianniu Guard.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:18.800 line:0%
I've long heard

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:21.020 line:0%
that the Imperial Security Bureau and the Imperial Investigation Department

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:22.230 line:0%
are in cahoots,

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.310 line:0%
but I never expected

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:25.930 line:0%
that the Qianniu Guard would also side with the Lai faction.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.350 line:0%
Your Majesty have been ill for a long time,

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.720 line:0%
perhaps you're become confused.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:29.970 line:0%
What should be said,

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.250 line:0%
what should be done,

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:33.850 line:0%
I suppose I'll have to remind you.

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:55.780 line:0%
Do Your Majesty truly have nothing

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.390 line:0%
to say to the ministers?

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.090 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.930 line:0%
how dare you surround the palace with troops,

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.280 line:0%
intending to rebel?

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:04.990 line:0%
The Mandate of Heaven has shifted,

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.250 line:0%
it is truly where the people's hearts lie.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.000 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.090 line:0%
you're insolent!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.760 line:0%
I didn't expect

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.040 line:0%
Your Majesty would actually

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.650 line:0%
fight to the death.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.180 line:0%
What a pity.

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.920 line:0%
It didn't have to be this way.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.460 line:0%
Now that it's come to this,

00:04:20.879 --> 00:04:22.220 line:0%
you know

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.600 line:0%
how to write

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:25.680 line:0%
the abdication edict, don't you?

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.120 line:0%
Absurd!

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.330 line:0%
What qualifications do you have

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.850 line:0%
to inherit the unified throne?

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.980 line:0%
What if I do have such qualifications?

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.360 line:0%
One should receive the Mandate of Heaven,

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:38.520 line:0%
and establish the supreme authority.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:40.450 line:0%
Such wild ambition!

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.310 line:0%
Your intentions are punishable by death.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.530 line:0%
So noisy.

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:44.650 line:0%
Take these pedantic fools

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:45.890 line:0%
and drag them out.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:47.410 line:0%
Cut out their tongues.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:52.440 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.160 line:0%
why aren't you acting?

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:00.570 line:0%
You want to sit on this throne,

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.410 line:0%
but you're not qualified yet.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:03.820 line:0%
The Imperial Guards!

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.750 line:0%
I am Shen Du of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.450 line:0%
I have thoroughly investigated the Imperial Guards

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:19.090 line:0%
and purged the traitors among them.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:21.490 line:0%
Today, I lead troops to protect the sacred,

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.120 line:0%
only to capture the rebels.

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:26.890 line:0%
Dozens of lives from the Shen family

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.120 line:0%
were unjustly taken.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.360 line:0%
Don't you want

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:30.720 line:0%
to avenge them?

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.250 line:0%
Think about your father, Shen Bingzhu.

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:35.010 line:0%
Don't you want to clear his name?

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:36.610 line:0%
I will uncover the truth myself

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:38.610 line:0%
and seek justice for the Shen family.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:39.930 line:0%
You are unworthy to

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:42.500 line:0%
stand with me.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.340 line:0%
So,

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.280 line:0%
according to your speculation,

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.330 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect has been

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.120 line:0%
quietly nurtured and grown over the years

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:57.310 line:0%
because someone in the court has been assisting them.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.410 line:0%
This person

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:01.600 line:0%
is most likely to be Lai Luozhi?

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:02.990 line:0%
Although there's no concrete evidence,

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:04.570 line:0%
various signs indicate that

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:05.450 line:0%
Lai Luozhi is

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.350 line:0%
inextricably linked to this matter.

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:08.720 line:0%
The Fire Moth Sect covets power in the court,

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.410 line:0%
attempting to gain leverage over

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.070 line:0%
Princess Yong'an and others.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.670 line:0%
They're instigating conflicts within the royal family,

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:13.890 line:0%
which shows that the person behind this

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:15.210 line:0%
has deep-seated intentions

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:16.650 line:0%
and even greater ambitions.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:19.720 line:0%
They even dare to meddle with the cinnabar

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.120 line:0%
controlled by the court.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.360 line:0%
We can be certain that your speculation

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.160 line:0%
is most likely correct.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:29.090 line:0%
What do you think?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.580 line:0%
The enemy is hidden.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:33.880 line:0%
We might as well go with the flow

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.290 line:0%
and pay a man back in his own coin.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.890 line:0%
Pay a man back in his own coin.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:39.750 line:0%
Good.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.040 line:0%
I want to see

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.720 line:0%
how effective your trap

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:44.650 line:0%
will be.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.420 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:47.770 line:0%
Shen Du

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.090 line:0%
specially got this spiritual medicine

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.290 line:0%
from the Jinwu Tribe.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.120 line:0%
It was secretly sent into the palace.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:53.780 line:0%
They say it's exactly for this condition.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:54.610 line:0%
After drinking it,

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:56.340 line:0%
you'll recover in half a month.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.330 line:0%
What a clever move of hiding your true intentions.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.930 line:0%
You pretended to surrender,

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.330 line:0%
and you even went so far as to use yourself

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.210 line:0%
and those around you as a gamble.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.570 line:0%
Rather than saying I pretended to deceive you,

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.650 line:0%
it's more accurate to say your arrogance

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:10.360 line:0%
led you to fall into

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.920 line:0%
a trap that was set long ago.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.680 line:0%
There's no point in saying more.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:16.210 line:0%
It's still uncertain who will come out on top.

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:18.920 line:0%
The fire moths rise,

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.820 line:0%
revealing all living beings!

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.680 line:0%
These envoys are fake.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.390 line:0%
I have never fully trusted you either.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.850 line:0%
Now, the commanders of the six garrison troops

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.330 line:0%
are all loyal to me.

00:07:35.459 --> 00:07:36.680 line:0%
Just now,

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.520 line:0%
they have surrounded the palace with their troops.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.520 line:0%
What do you have to fight against me?

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:42.280 line:0%
The tide has turned now.

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.600 line:0%
It's too late

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:44.530 line:0%
for regrets!

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.370 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.800 line:0%
You could have been my

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:49.530 line:0%
founding hero.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:51.290 line:0%
What a pity.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.280 line:0%
Leave no one alive.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:57.780 line:0%
Kill them all.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:46.180 line:0%
Everything will be fine.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.900 line:0%
I will protect you.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:52.170 line:0%
You will definitely ascend

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:54.040 line:0%
to the throne.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.660 line:0%
You certainly will.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.440 line:0%
I won't let you die in vain.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:49.700 line:0%
General Zhenyuan's

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:50.850 line:0%
troops moved swiftly,

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:51.870 line:0%
quelling the rebellion in time.

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:53.170 line:0%
As expected of our Cang State's

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.030 line:0%
top general guarding the border.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:11.920 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:12.960 line:0%
the troops of the Six Garrisons

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.880 line:0%
have secretly sided with Lai Luozhi.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:16.360 line:0%
The deployable forces within the city

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.890 line:0%
may not be enough to resist.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:18.860 line:0%
Currently, all prefectures

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:19.790 line:0%
are being monitored

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:20.960 line:0%
by the people of Fire Moth Sect.

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:23.110 line:0%
Only one person can break up this situation.

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:24.520 line:0%
To avoid alerting the enemy,

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.780 line:0%
I humbly request Your Highness's personal assistance

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:28.340 line:0%
to lift the siege of Xiang'an

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:29.930 line:0%
and quell the rebellion in Cang State.

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:31.830 line:0%
Thanks to Your Highness personally sending a secret letter

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:32.990 line:0%
to convey the imperial will.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.620 line:0%
I never imagined there would be someone in the court

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.170 line:0%
who dared to collude with the enemy,

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.830 line:0%
attempting to create chaos at the border

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:38.830 line:0%
to trap me.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.040 line:0%
[General Zhenyuan]

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:41.210 line:0%
He would never have expected

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:42.400 line:0%
that an elite team

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:44.990 line:0%
had already departed for Xiang'an.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.130 line:0%
Lai Luozhi deceives people's hearts,

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:48.630 line:0%
but he never considered

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:49.630 line:0%
that everyone in this hall

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.390 line:0%
is my closest confidant.

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:52.860 line:0%
Now, His Majesty

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.300 line:0%
is even my own nephew.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:55.750 line:0%
As citizens of Cang State,

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:56.870 line:0%
at this moment,

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:59.700 line:0%
we must stand with our country and our people.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.990 line:0%
My Fire Moth Sect disciples are countless.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:04.580 line:0%
Within Cang State,

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:05.940 line:0%
the various branches of the Fire Moth Sect

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:08.060 line:0%
rose up in rebellion with me today;

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:09.620 line:0%
how do you plan to defeat us?

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.690 line:0%
Do you intend to make all the citizens of Xiang'an City

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.280 line:0%
die along with you?

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.320 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:17.920 line:0%
The rebels outside the palace have been completely eliminated.

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:36.220 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.280 line:0%
surrender now.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.040 line:0%
Just moments ago,

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:41.940 line:0%
all of your Fire Moth Sect forces deployed across the country

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.180 line:0%
have been wiped out.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.700 line:0%
The tide that was in your favor

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.050 line:0%
has turned.

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.250 line:0%
On the day of the Grand Court Assembly,

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.170 line:0%
Lai Luozhi would surely

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:53.840 line:0%
concentrate his forces at the imperial palace.

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:54.960 line:0%
Jiang Langxing would deliver the message

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.490 line:0%
to the constables in various regions.

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:57.490 line:0%
At that time,

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:58.490 line:0%
it would be the moment to eliminate

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:01.350 line:0%
all Fire Moth Sect strongholds across the country.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.210 line:0%
Attention, all constables!

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.630 line:0%
Clear out all the strongholds of the Fire Moth Sect

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:17.610 line:0%
in the outer counties.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.110 line:0%
Capture all the cult members.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.240 line:0%
Don't let a single one escape.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:20.910 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:41.410 line:0%
[North Gate]

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:39.710 line:0%
Liang,

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:40.580 line:0%
if the new crossbow you designed

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:41.840 line:0%
is successfully manufactured,

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.940 line:0%
capable of firing multiple arrows at once,

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:44.270 line:0%
it would be invincible.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.630 line:0%
It would allow our army to fight ten to one.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.790 line:0%
Then, just one elite squad

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:50.410 line:0%
could defeat a larger force.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:53.380 line:0%
The weapons from the Liang family are truly marvelous.

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:54.460 line:0%
In quelling this rebellion,

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:56.130 line:0%
the Liang family's contribution is indispensable.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.720 line:0%
It's all thanks to Shen's unwavering support

00:13:57.720 --> 00:13:58.970 line:0%
and encouragement.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.850 line:0%
[North Gate]

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.290 line:0%
You insects,

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.520 line:0%
pretending to be righteous,

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.980 line:0%
allowing Her Majesty to monopolize power,

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.640 line:0%
incompetent and tyrannical.

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.770 line:0%
Who is the culprit poisoning the foundation

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.210 line:0%
of our Cang State?

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:41.320 line:0%
It's her,

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:42.720 line:0%
Zhou Xu!

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:43.690 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:45.900 line:0%
you established the Fire Moth Sect,

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:46.770 line:0%
deceiving people with tricks,

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:48.020 line:0%
harming the loyal and good.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:50.750 line:0%
The number of people you've harmed is countless.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:51.850 line:0%
What right do you have

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.510 line:0%
to speak so shamelessly here?

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:55.640 line:0%
The reason my Fire Moth Sect can be

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.130 line:0%
omnipresent in Cang State

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.130 line:0%
is because I gave people

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:00.420 line:0%
the creation of

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:02.640 line:0%
a beautiful dream of resurrection.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:04.890 line:0%
As humans,

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.220 line:0%
who can escape birth, aging, sickness, and death?

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.190 line:0%
Who can avoid

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.860 line:0%
the pain of losing their loved ones?

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:18.600 line:0%
Not to mention ordinary people,

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:20.240 line:0%
even those high-ranking officials and nobles,

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:21.120 line:0%
what of it?

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:23.990 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi also believes in me,

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:26.160 line:0%
acting under my control.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.520 line:0%
You shameless scoundrel!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.160 line:0%
I despise people like you,

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:35.290 line:0%
who are full of talk about benevolence and morality,

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.910 line:0%
and think so highly of themselves.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.140 line:0%
You're attempting to overthrow the foundation of our country.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.480 line:0%
How could I possibly side with such treachery?

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:40.810 line:0%
If my father were alive,

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.960 line:0%
he would never allow this either.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:47.070 line:0%
I, Shen Du, am first and foremost a citizen of Cang State,

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:49.130 line:0%
and only then a son of the Shen family.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:55.950 line:0%
Your father is a fool too.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.160 line:0%
I only want to remain true to my conscience

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.880 line:0%
and the common people.

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:02.110 line:0%
How could I possibly

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:04.120 line:0%
collude with the likes of you?

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:07.150 line:0%
He thinks he's upright and incorruptible,

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.700 line:0%
but he's already made countless enemies.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.760 line:0%
Those who want to see him dead

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:12.880 line:0%
are numerous.

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:14.370 line:0%
You,

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:16.530 line:0%
you're just as foolish as your father.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.550 line:0%
I only used a few small tricks,

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:20.990 line:0%
and I can make your Shen family

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:22.140 line:0%
fall into ruin.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:23.790 line:0%
Harming the loyal and good,

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.130 line:0%
you've gone mad with cruelty.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.550 line:0%
Your delusions of power

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.070 line:0%
are intolerable even to Heaven's will.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:29.070 line:0%
Heaven's will?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.270 line:0%
Then let me ask you,

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:36.270 line:0%
who determined the Shen family's guilt?

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:38.940 line:0%
Who is truly responsible for the destruction

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.050 line:0%
of the Shen family?

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:50.020 line:0%
Zhou Xu,

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:52.070 line:0%
you're manipulating this young mute emperor

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.480 line:0%
to control the government.

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:55.680 line:0%
Have you ever woken up in the middle of the night,

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.430 line:0%
feeling guilty towards the late emperor,

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:58.940 line:0%
my royal father?

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:04.159 line:0%
I am the true chosen one,

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:06.720 line:0%
possessing the most supreme bloodline.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:07.810 line:0%
Today,

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.750 line:0%
I shall rectify the wrongs

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:11.139 line:0%
for the Xiao dynasty.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.610 line:0%
The late emperor...

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:14.280 line:0%
Could he be...

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:18.280 line:0%
I am the son

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.980 line:0%
of the late emperor's Consort Shu.

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.770 line:0%
The phoenix leads nine chicks.

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:30.040 line:0%
Peace reigns under heaven.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.820 line:0%
Rectify the root and clarify the source.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:34.830 line:0%
Reestablish the universe.

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.890 line:0%
Rectify the root and clarify the source.

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:40.420 line:0%
Reestablish the universe.

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:44.400 line:0%
Could it be that

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:46.790 line:0%
the state preceptor's prophecy

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.360 line:0%
really has a second half?

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.900 line:0%
This statement is incorrect.

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:57.420 line:0%
I'm Yan Xing, the Director in the Ministry of Justice.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.550 line:0%
Greetings,

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.080 line:0%
Your Majesties.

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:03.470 line:0%
Please rise.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.840 line:0%
Reporting to Your Majesty,

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:12.020 line:0%
the state preceptor's prophecy indeed has a second half,

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.830 line:0%
which I didn't have the chance to present earlier.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:16.350 line:0%
It's certainly not what Lai Luozhi just claimed.

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:17.810 line:0%
What evidence do you have?

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.230 line:0%
The true prophecy

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.630 line:0%
is hidden within this undergarment.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:33.200 line:0%
The sun sets in the clear sky.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:34.860 line:0%
Calamity will come in return.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:37.790 line:0%
That's right.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.280 line:0%
The state preceptor made a prophecy that day.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:41.240 line:0%
The latter half

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:42.650 line:0%
refers hidden ambitious schemes

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:44.240 line:0%
among the court officials.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.320 line:0%
It intended to remind Your Majesty

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:47.980 line:0%
to be wary of those around you.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.430 line:0%
Lai Luozhi has painstakingly managed

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:50.590 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect for many years.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:53.230 line:0%
The cultists have been secretly causing trouble.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.920 line:0%
The state preceptor noticed something amiss,

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:55.670 line:0%
and because of this,

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:56.770 line:0%
he became suspicious

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.230 line:0%
of Lai Luozhi's identity.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.260 line:0%
Lacking evidence,

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:00.900 line:0%
[The sun sets in the clear sky.]

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.370 line:0%
the state preceptor had no choice but to convey his suspicions

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.980 line:0%
[The sun sets in the clear sky. Calamity will come in return.]

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.450 line:0%
to the world through a prophecy.

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:11.580 line:0%
[The sun sets in the clear sky.]

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.610 line:0%
Perhaps realizing that his movements

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:15.060 line:0%
were being secretly monitored by Lai Luozhi,

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:16.100 line:0%
he had to embroider the prophecy

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:17.470 line:0%
on a piece of brocade,

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.230 line:0%
hiding it within the patterns,

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:20.860 line:0%
waiting for the right moment

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:21.940 line:0%
to pass it on.

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:23.130 line:0%
Unexpectedly,

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:25.030 line:0%
he was assassinated and silenced

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.300 line:0%
by people sent by Lai Luozhi.

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.440 line:0%
But heaven's net is wide-meshed, yet lets nothing through.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.510 line:0%
The brocade with the second half of the prophecy

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.170 line:0%
was coincidentally picked up by the illiterate Yuanniang,

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:39.820 line:0%
who thought it was just good fabric.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:42.010 line:0%
She made it into the lining of a baby's shirt,

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.360 line:0%
and so it was preserved.

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:48.740 line:0%
[There is a triangular needle wound on Yuanniang's body]

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:54.760 line:0%
If Yuanniang were just an ordinary woman,

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:55.940 line:0%
how could she afford

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.220 line:0%
such fabric?

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:00.000 line:0%
This inner fabric

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.960 line:0%
is certainly not something

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:04.110 line:0%
that ordinary families could obtain.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:08.000 line:0%
The state preceptor is pedantic,

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.400 line:0%
stubborn and obstinate.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.030 line:0%
Do we really want to hand over the country

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:12.720 line:0%
to a foolish child

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:15.110 line:0%
Or that useless Prince Xian?

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:18.460 line:0%
Or the arrogant and domineering Princess Yong'an?

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:19.720 line:0%
As long as Your Majesty

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:20.830 line:0%
remain in court for one more day,

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:22.510 line:0%
no one can feel at ease.

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:26.810 line:0%
Once upon a time,

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:28.710 line:0%
Princess Runing

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.700 line:0%
was just as noble and revered.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:32.830 line:0%
Yet she was merely

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:36.470 line:0%
framed by someone who switched the embroidery on her clothes,

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:38.870 line:0%
and was accused of treason and usurpation,

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.290 line:0%
leading to her current fate.

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:46.330 line:0%
So,

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:48.420 line:0%
Princess Runing

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:51.610 line:0%
was also framed by your schemes.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.820 line:0%
If you hadn't been so suspicious,

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:55.900 line:0%
how could I have succeeded so easily?

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:57.870 line:0%
You have only yourself to blame.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:58.920 line:0%
You, Zhou Xu,

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:01.450 line:0%
are the real threat to the Xiao imperial clan.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:04.120 line:0%
As a descendant of the Xiao family,

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.650 line:0%
it is my duty to restore order to Cang State.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.300 line:0%
The throne rightfully belongs to me

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:10.990 line:0%
by divine mandate.

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:13.900 line:0%
I am the most legitimate heir to the throne.

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:16.160 line:0%
But you are not the late emperor's son.

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:19.020 line:0%
You are the child of the late emperor's favored concubine, Consort Shu,

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:21.150 line:0%
born from her affair with another man.

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:33.830 line:0%
Consort Shu was originally from the Nanlang State,

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:35.630 line:0%
the carefree Princess Biluo.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:35.530 line:0%
[The child born from the illicit affair of the late emperor's favored concubine, Consort Shu, has vanished without a trace, and that child is Lai Luozhi.]

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:37.760 line:0%
She fell in love with General Kongshan,

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:39.010 line:0%
and they secretly pledged to marry.

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:40.800 line:0%
It was meant to be a beautiful love story,

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:42.320 line:0%
but her father, the King of Nanlang,

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:44.260 line:0%
forced her to marry into Cang State with an imperial edict.

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:46.260 line:0%
She was to be wed to the late emperor.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:48.600 line:0%
Princess Biluo swore she would rather die than comply.

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:49.770 line:0%
In a fit of rage, the King of Nanlang

00:21:49.770 --> 00:21:51.160 line:0%
killed General Kongshan.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:54.010 line:0%
He further threatened the lives of the general's entire clan.

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:55.950 line:0%
Biluo had no choice but to bribe the palace eunuchs

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:57.810 line:0%
to escape the palace inspection.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.240 line:0%
She became known as

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:00.440 line:0%
the infamous Consort Shu.

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:01.170 line:0%
From then on,

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:03.470 line:0%
she lost her love

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:05.720 line:0%
and her name.

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:07.550 line:0%
Her reason for living on

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:09.560 line:0%
was not only to protect General Kongshan's clan,

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:10.930 line:0%
but also for the sake of

00:22:10.960 --> 00:22:13.960 line:0%
the child of General Kongshan she carried in her womb.

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:26.450 line:0%
This can't be true.

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:28.510 line:0%
It's impossible.

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:30.820 line:0%
My mother would never lie to me.

00:22:31.270 --> 00:22:33.270 line:0%
I am a descendant of the Xiao family.

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:35.830 line:0%
I am the son of the late emperor of Cang State.

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:37.440 line:0%
In the past, when Nanlang

00:22:37.440 --> 00:22:38.650 line:0%
escorted Princess Biluo to Cang State,

00:22:38.650 --> 00:22:40.170 line:0%
someone in the entourage

00:22:40.200 --> 00:22:42.240 line:0%
noticed that she was unwell

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:43.490 line:0%
and discovered this matter.

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:45.310 line:0%
Consequently, she secretly attempted to silence them.

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:47.840 line:0%
Fortunately, this person managed to escape.

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:49.130 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:51.440 line:0%
You are not of the Xiao bloodline at all.

00:22:58.190 --> 00:22:59.140 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:01.400 line:0%
Your entire life

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:03.970 line:0%
is nothing but a complete lie.

00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:18.860 line:0%
Impossible.

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:22.080 line:0%
My mother would never lie to me.

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.030 line:0%
My mother would never lie to me.

00:23:24.230 --> 00:23:25.960 line:0%
You mediocre rats,

00:23:25.980 --> 00:23:27.690 line:0%
you're all Zhou Xu's lapdogs.

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:28.970 line:0%
You fabricate lies,

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.110 line:0%
deceiving heaven and earth,

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:30.830 line:0%
all to

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:32.320 line:0%
prevent me from ascending to the throne

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:33.730 line:0%
and saving the world.

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:52.500 line:0%
Moths to a flame.

00:23:53.230 --> 00:23:54.710 line:0%
Born at dawn,

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:57.900 line:0%
dead by dusk!

00:24:38.970 --> 00:24:40.060 line:0%
So,

00:24:42.190 --> 00:24:44.390 line:0%
moths flying to a flame

00:24:47.190 --> 00:24:51.710 line:0%
was all just a grand dream after all.

00:25:10.340 --> 00:25:10.940 line:0%
Open the door.

00:25:10.940 --> 00:25:11.420 line:0%
Yes.

00:25:14.700 --> 00:25:15.870 line:0%
Greetings, Guard Jing.

00:25:15.870 --> 00:25:16.790 line:0%
The Lai Faction has been brought to justice.

00:25:16.790 --> 00:25:17.630 line:0%
Grand Commander sent me here

00:25:17.630 --> 00:25:18.900 line:0%
to escort you home immediately.

00:25:18.900 --> 00:25:20.090 line:0%
Thank you for your hard work these past few days.

00:25:20.090 --> 00:25:21.360 line:0%
If the Imperial Security Bureau has been negligent in any way,

00:25:21.360 --> 00:25:22.890 line:0%
I ask for your forgiveness.

00:25:23.060 --> 00:25:24.090 line:0%
That's great!

00:25:24.340 --> 00:25:25.190 line:0%
Guard Jing,

00:25:25.210 --> 00:25:26.130 line:0%
you're too kind.

00:25:26.130 --> 00:25:27.240 line:0%
The Grand Commander

00:25:27.240 --> 00:25:28.460 line:0%
put us in the Imperial Security Bureau's prison,

00:25:28.460 --> 00:25:29.600 line:0%
which was actually to protect

00:25:29.600 --> 00:25:31.190 line:0%
us from harm by the Lai Faction.

00:25:31.190 --> 00:25:31.880 line:0%
How

00:25:31.900 --> 00:25:33.280 line:0%
could we not understand?

00:25:33.280 --> 00:25:35.350 line:0%
Yes, yes, yes.

00:25:36.810 --> 00:25:38.420 line:0%
[Cangming Hall]

00:25:39.070 --> 00:25:39.870 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:25:40.230 --> 00:25:41.430 line:0%
you must understand,

00:25:41.940 --> 00:25:43.460 line:0%
once the arrow is released from the bow,

00:25:43.460 --> 00:25:44.980 line:0%
there's no turning back.

00:25:45.970 --> 00:25:47.100 line:0%
I've made up my mind.

00:25:47.590 --> 00:25:48.640 line:0%
Madam Xu, please

00:25:48.640 --> 00:25:50.030 line:0%
inform Her Majesty.

00:26:18.510 --> 00:26:20.060 line:0%
Director Yan, please come back another day.

00:26:20.060 --> 00:26:21.050 line:0%
Her Majesty will

00:26:21.080 --> 00:26:22.170 line:0%
summon me shortly.

00:26:22.710 --> 00:26:24.310 line:0%
She has no time to see you now.

00:26:25.380 --> 00:26:26.830 line:0%
The officials of the Lai Faction

00:26:26.830 --> 00:26:29.160 line:0%
have all been ordered to be investigated.

00:26:29.260 --> 00:26:31.060 line:0%
What is the purpose of

00:26:31.470 --> 00:26:33.000 line:0%
meeting Her Majesty today?

00:26:35.510 --> 00:26:37.050 line:0%
I, as the Grand Commander, have pacified the rebels

00:26:37.050 --> 00:26:38.800 line:0%
and rendered great service to Cang State.

00:26:38.800 --> 00:26:40.850 line:0%
I'm asking Her Majesty for a reward.

00:26:41.590 --> 00:26:42.560 line:0%
Do I need to explain this

00:26:42.560 --> 00:26:44.020 line:0%
to a sixth-rank official?

00:26:46.180 --> 00:26:47.940 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, then I must accompany you

00:26:47.940 --> 00:26:49.250 line:0%
to meet Her Majesty.

00:26:49.390 --> 00:26:51.070 line:0%
Suppressing the rebels wasn't your achievement alone.

00:26:51.070 --> 00:26:52.400 line:0%
I contributed as well.

00:26:52.480 --> 00:26:53.280 line:0%
This reward,

00:26:54.350 --> 00:26:56.100 line:0%
you can't have it all to yourself.

00:26:56.100 --> 00:26:57.230 line:0%
If you want a reward,

00:26:57.560 --> 00:26:58.830 line:0%
have your superior at the Ministry of Justice

00:26:58.830 --> 00:27:00.070 line:0%
submit a memorial.

00:27:00.090 --> 00:27:00.930 line:0%
Director Yan,

00:27:01.270 --> 00:27:02.270 line:0%
you may leave now.

00:27:04.100 --> 00:27:05.650 line:0%
Who asks for a reward

00:27:06.520 --> 00:27:08.450 line:0%
while bringing a gift themselves?

00:27:10.820 --> 00:27:12.820 line:0%
I suppose what's in this brocade box

00:27:13.400 --> 00:27:15.060 line:0%
is that evidence that shocked

00:27:15.090 --> 00:27:16.620 line:0%
the entire court, isn't it?

00:27:16.990 --> 00:27:18.030 line:0%
You're here today

00:27:18.050 --> 00:27:18.910 line:0%
for the Shen family, aren't you?

00:27:18.910 --> 00:27:19.710 line:0%
Director Yan,

00:27:21.300 --> 00:27:22.300 line:0%
watch your words.

00:27:24.990 --> 00:27:26.690 line:0%
We are now divorced.

00:27:26.920 --> 00:27:28.680 line:0%
You are no longer a member of the Shen family.

00:27:28.680 --> 00:27:29.560 line:0%
The affairs of my Shen family

00:27:29.560 --> 00:27:31.090 line:0%
are no longer your concern.

00:27:37.360 --> 00:27:38.170 line:0%
Fine.

00:27:40.450 --> 00:27:42.660 line:0%
Even if I'm not part of the Shen family anymore,

00:27:42.660 --> 00:27:44.920 line:0%
I will see this matter through to the end.

00:27:45.090 --> 00:27:46.330 line:0%
I stand here

00:27:47.160 --> 00:27:47.830 line:0%
not as

00:27:47.830 --> 00:27:49.830 line:0%
your wife,

00:27:50.010 --> 00:27:50.750 line:0%
but in my capacity as

00:27:50.750 --> 00:27:52.670 line:0%
the Director in the Ministry of Justice.

00:27:52.670 --> 00:27:54.000 line:0%
To reinvestigate wrongful convictions

00:27:54.000 --> 00:27:55.460 line:0%
and restore justice to the world.

00:27:55.460 --> 00:27:57.220 line:0%
This is my ideal.

00:28:02.710 --> 00:28:03.970 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:28:04.030 --> 00:28:06.090 line:0%
Her Majesty has summoned you inside.

00:28:08.840 --> 00:28:10.280 line:0%
Since you are an official in the Ministry of Justice,

00:28:10.280 --> 00:28:11.650 line:0%
you should be even more aware

00:28:11.650 --> 00:28:12.960 line:0%
Her Majesty has summoned

00:28:12.960 --> 00:28:13.890 line:0%
me, the Grand Commander.

00:28:13.890 --> 00:28:15.820 line:0%
How can you come uninvited?

00:28:17.380 --> 00:28:19.580 line:0%
Are you planning to barge into the hall?

00:28:20.850 --> 00:28:22.450 line:0%
If you go in alone,

00:28:23.110 --> 00:28:24.840 line:0%
then we need not meet again.

00:29:02.220 --> 00:29:04.540 line:0%
The Emperor has caught a cold.

00:29:05.400 --> 00:29:06.760 line:0%
Rest for a day,

00:29:07.430 --> 00:29:09.160 line:0%
and attend court tomorrow.

00:29:09.640 --> 00:29:10.900 line:0%
My beloved ministers,

00:29:11.850 --> 00:29:13.820 line:0%
is there any memorial to present?

00:29:19.620 --> 00:29:20.890 line:0%
Qiao Wenzhi,

00:29:21.840 --> 00:29:23.800 line:0%
you are in charge of Gannan Area.

00:29:24.010 --> 00:29:25.080 line:0%
Today,

00:29:25.410 --> 00:29:27.070 line:0%
is there any matter to report?

00:29:27.950 --> 00:29:29.380 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:29:30.180 --> 00:29:32.140 line:0%
since Lai Faction was executed,

00:29:32.180 --> 00:29:35.160 line:0%
our Cang State has been prosperous with people living in peace,

00:29:35.160 --> 00:29:37.620 line:0%
especially Gannan Area, which is thriving,

00:29:37.640 --> 00:29:39.250 line:0%
truly, the world is at peace.

00:29:39.530 --> 00:29:41.210 line:0%
There is nothing to report.

00:29:41.960 --> 00:29:44.240 line:0%
You sound nice.

00:29:44.610 --> 00:29:46.650 line:0%
The Lai Faction has been executed,

00:29:47.670 --> 00:29:49.670 line:0%
but the ledgers he left behind

00:29:50.450 --> 00:29:51.980 line:0%
are very useful.

00:29:54.010 --> 00:29:55.010 line:0%
Qiao Wenzhi,

00:29:55.430 --> 00:29:58.100 line:0%
you've been smuggling goods from Xichen

00:29:58.480 --> 00:30:02.980 line:0%
through Gannan Area into Cang State for profit.

00:30:05.080 --> 00:30:06.190 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:30:06.220 --> 00:30:07.130 line:0%
it's unjust!

00:30:07.150 --> 00:30:08.550 line:0%
The so-called evidence they left behind

00:30:08.550 --> 00:30:10.050 line:0%
by those rebels from Gannan Area

00:30:10.050 --> 00:30:11.110 line:0%
cannot be used as proof.

00:30:11.110 --> 00:30:12.220 line:0%
It's not credible!

00:30:12.240 --> 00:30:13.440 line:0%
Not credible?

00:30:20.530 --> 00:30:21.330 line:0%
Then,

00:30:21.690 --> 00:30:23.710 line:0%
how do you explain these two sets of books,

00:30:23.710 --> 00:30:25.040 line:0%
one true and one false?

00:30:27.000 --> 00:30:29.460 line:0%
These weren't submitted by the Lai Faction.

00:30:30.620 --> 00:30:32.680 line:0%
For the reconstruction of Ming Hall,

00:30:32.870 --> 00:30:34.950 line:0%
the real accounts and the fake ones,

00:30:35.340 --> 00:30:37.310 line:0%
differ by a full two times.

00:30:39.640 --> 00:30:40.660 line:0%
But the reconstruction of the Ming Hall

00:30:40.660 --> 00:30:42.230 line:0%
involved all departments.

00:30:42.250 --> 00:30:43.150 line:0%
It's not just me.

00:30:43.150 --> 00:30:44.000 line:0%
Qiao Wenzhi.

00:30:46.070 --> 00:30:48.360 line:0%
Stop talking nonsense!

00:30:52.940 --> 00:30:54.450 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:30:54.870 --> 00:30:55.790 line:0%
Qiao Wenzhi

00:30:56.250 --> 00:30:58.160 line:0%
is an official under my command.

00:30:58.280 --> 00:30:59.920 line:0%
He was blinded by greed.

00:30:59.950 --> 00:31:01.550 line:0%
He embezzled the court's silver.

00:31:01.550 --> 00:31:03.230 line:0%
He committed a grave crime.

00:31:03.450 --> 00:31:06.550 line:0%
It's all my fault for not supervising properly.

00:31:06.960 --> 00:31:09.380 line:0%
I ask Your Majesty to punish me.

00:31:09.750 --> 00:31:11.950 line:0%
The fault of not supervising properly.

00:31:12.700 --> 00:31:15.140 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang, you are truly knowledgeable.

00:31:15.140 --> 00:31:17.050 line:0%
Your choice of words is exquisite.

00:31:17.050 --> 00:31:18.640 line:0%
But this Qiao Wenzhi

00:31:19.130 --> 00:31:21.460 line:0%
is very loyal to you.

00:31:21.630 --> 00:31:23.190 line:0%
The majority of the embezzled funds

00:31:23.190 --> 00:31:25.160 line:0%
from the Ming Hall project

00:31:25.180 --> 00:31:27.380 line:0%
ended up in your pocket, Zhang Xingwei.

00:31:29.340 --> 00:31:30.510 line:0%
Zhang Xingwei.

00:31:30.830 --> 00:31:32.720 line:0%
Do you have anything else to say?

00:31:35.760 --> 00:31:36.550 line:0%
I

00:31:37.870 --> 00:31:39.310 line:0%
have nothing to say.

00:31:39.390 --> 00:31:40.420 line:0%
Prince Xian.

00:31:42.700 --> 00:31:43.510 line:0%
Mother.

00:31:44.060 --> 00:31:45.380 line:0%
Let me ask you.

00:31:46.160 --> 00:31:48.100 line:0%
How should we deal with him?

00:31:49.230 --> 00:31:50.710 line:0%
Mother, you are wise and decisive.

00:31:50.710 --> 00:31:51.920 line:0%
You have your own judgment.

00:31:51.920 --> 00:31:54.090 line:0%
I have my own judgment?

00:31:54.220 --> 00:31:55.820 line:0%
But I'm asking you now

00:31:56.590 --> 00:31:58.350 line:0%
what your judgement is.

00:31:59.780 --> 00:32:01.940 line:0%
I have been under Prime Minister Zhang's tutelage since childhood.

00:32:01.940 --> 00:32:03.840 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang has always led by example

00:32:03.840 --> 00:32:04.750 line:0%
in educating me

00:32:04.770 --> 00:32:06.750 line:0%
to always prioritize the welfare of the state.

00:32:06.750 --> 00:32:07.920 line:0%
I don't believe

00:32:07.950 --> 00:32:09.140 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang would commit such a crime

00:32:09.140 --> 00:32:10.140 line:0%
for mere silver.

00:32:11.010 --> 00:32:11.810 line:0%
This case

00:32:12.940 --> 00:32:14.800 line:0%
must have hidden circumstances.

00:32:17.290 --> 00:32:19.230 line:0%
Prince Xian,

00:32:19.260 --> 00:32:21.060 line:0%
you are so confused.

00:32:21.090 --> 00:32:24.210 line:0%
It was all my pretense.

00:32:24.240 --> 00:32:25.970 line:0%
I've deceived you for so many years.

00:32:25.970 --> 00:32:28.570 line:0%
Yet you still plead for me.

00:32:33.440 --> 00:32:34.560 line:0%
Well, well.

00:32:34.950 --> 00:32:37.530 line:0%
What a touching relationship between teacher and student.

00:32:37.530 --> 00:32:38.790 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang,

00:32:38.840 --> 00:32:41.230 line:0%
let me speak on your behalf.

00:32:41.360 --> 00:32:43.140 line:0%
You obtained this silver,

00:32:43.340 --> 00:32:45.360 line:0%
but didn't spend any of it on yourself.

00:32:45.360 --> 00:32:46.710 line:0%
In the court,

00:32:46.740 --> 00:32:48.270 line:0%
you bribed allies

00:32:48.290 --> 00:32:49.560 line:0%
for the purpose of

00:32:49.590 --> 00:32:52.720 line:0%
inviting them to support Prince Xian together with you.

00:33:04.340 --> 00:33:05.820 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:33:06.730 --> 00:33:08.260 line:0%
now that it has come to this,

00:33:08.630 --> 00:33:09.420 line:0%
I

00:33:10.310 --> 00:33:12.170 line:0%
will no longer conceal anything.

00:33:13.480 --> 00:33:14.370 line:0%
In this matter,

00:33:15.570 --> 00:33:17.090 line:0%
Prince Xian

00:33:17.480 --> 00:33:19.400 line:0%
truly knows nothing.

00:33:21.630 --> 00:33:24.100 line:0%
It was all done by me alone.

00:33:24.370 --> 00:33:27.230 line:0%
I request Your Majesty to grant me the death penalty

00:33:27.450 --> 00:33:29.180 line:0%
to serve as a warning to others.

00:33:29.190 --> 00:33:30.990 line:0%
You think sacrificing your life

00:33:31.020 --> 00:33:31.840 line:0%
will erase your sins

00:33:31.840 --> 00:33:33.390 line:0%
just like that?

00:33:36.760 --> 00:33:39.290 line:0%
Families that were destroyed because of you,

00:33:39.340 --> 00:33:41.750 line:0%
the loyal officials who died unjustly

00:33:42.230 --> 00:33:46.340 line:0%
can never be brought back to life.

00:33:53.010 --> 00:33:54.230 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:33:54.590 --> 00:33:55.660 line:0%
present it.

00:34:06.620 --> 00:34:08.380 line:0%
In accordance with heaven's will and the times,

00:34:08.380 --> 00:34:10.050 line:0%
received this clear mandate.

00:34:10.070 --> 00:34:12.200 line:0%
The guilty minister, Shen Bingzhu,

00:34:12.240 --> 00:34:14.729 line:0%
secretly communicated with the enemy,

00:34:12.510 --> 00:34:14.470 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:34:14.749 --> 00:34:17.090 line:0%
burned our military grain storage,

00:34:17.269 --> 00:34:19.890 line:0%
leaked our weapons blueprint,

00:34:19.990 --> 00:34:21.789 line:0%
colluded with foreign powers,

00:34:21.920 --> 00:34:23.950 line:0%
and betrayed his country.

00:34:23.970 --> 00:34:26.220 line:0%
His crimes deserve execution.

00:34:26.240 --> 00:34:29.400 line:0%
The entire Shen family shall be imprisoned and exiled.

00:34:29.420 --> 00:34:32.600 line:0%
Let it be known far and wide.

00:34:33.769 --> 00:34:36.979 line:0%
I don't seek fame in future generations,

00:34:37.160 --> 00:34:39.260 line:0%
only to remain true to my conscience

00:34:37.729 --> 00:34:39.769 line:0%
♫The clash of gold and iron shatters the world♫

00:34:39.539 --> 00:34:41.810 line:0%
and the common people.

00:34:40.450 --> 00:34:42.689 line:0%
♫Together, we advance and retreat side by side♫

00:34:41.830 --> 00:34:44.120 line:0%
My mentor, Shen Bingzhu, was naturally indifferent to worldly affairs.

00:34:43.870 --> 00:34:45.519 line:0%
♫The vast world stands proud, without regret♫

00:34:44.150 --> 00:34:46.100 line:0%
He never wanted to get involved in court disputes.

00:34:46.100 --> 00:34:47.850 line:0%
He only cared about the common people.

00:34:46.410 --> 00:34:49.479 line:0%
♫We stand firmly against the forces of evil♫

00:34:47.880 --> 00:34:49.700 line:0%
No matter who it is or what position they hold,

00:34:49.700 --> 00:34:51.580 line:0%
he only did what he thought was right,

00:34:50.090 --> 00:34:52.729 line:0%
♫In dreams, a hundred turns unfold♫

00:34:51.600 --> 00:34:53.280 line:0%
and all he wanted was for the people to be at peace.

00:34:53.280 --> 00:34:55.340 line:0%
I live off the emperor's salary,

00:34:53.330 --> 00:34:55.370 line:0%
♫Destiny binds us, walking together through life♫

00:34:55.510 --> 00:34:57.260 line:0%
so naturally, I should shoulder his burdens,

00:34:56.720 --> 00:34:58.290 line:0%
♫Unforgettable, the brief encounter♫

00:34:57.790 --> 00:34:59.420 line:0%
I'll do anything for His Majesty.

00:34:59.420 --> 00:35:01.130 line:0%
♫Like petals flying in the wind♫

00:35:01.440 --> 00:35:04.870 line:0%
♫Through thick and thin, unwavering in heart♫

00:35:05.860 --> 00:35:07.200 line:0%
♫I'll be with you forever♫

00:35:06.460 --> 00:35:07.520 line:0%
I, Shen Du,

00:35:08.070 --> 00:35:12.290 line:0%
♫At least I have you to share both joy and sorrow♫

00:35:09.630 --> 00:35:11.500 line:0%
now seek justice for my father

00:35:13.380 --> 00:35:14.400 line:0%
Shen Bingzhu.

00:35:14.210 --> 00:35:17.280 line:0%
♫Unravel fate, fearless and unyielding♫

00:35:14.630 --> 00:35:17.630 line:0%
I, Shen Du, son of the criminal minister Shen Bingzhu,

00:35:18.180 --> 00:35:20.100 line:0%
am here to denounce my father!

00:35:18.690 --> 00:35:20.040 line:0%
♫A dream brings me back♫

00:35:20.660 --> 00:35:22.200 line:0%
He colluds with foreign powers

00:35:21.010 --> 00:35:25.360 line:0%
♫The scenery is bright, hand in hand, we go back together♫

00:35:22.720 --> 00:35:24.530 line:0%
and aids the rebels!

00:35:25.140 --> 00:35:26.550 line:0%
I hereby denounce!

00:35:26.720 --> 00:35:30.060 line:0%
♫Through thick and thin, unwavering in heart♫

00:35:27.480 --> 00:35:30.480 line:0%
I, Shen Du, son of the criminal minister Shen Bingzhu,

00:35:30.820 --> 00:35:32.660 line:0%
♫I'll be with you forever♫

00:35:31.000 --> 00:35:32.690 line:0%
am here to denounce my father!

00:35:33.410 --> 00:35:37.710 line:0%
♫At least I have you to share both joy and sorrow♫

00:35:33.640 --> 00:35:35.710 line:0%
He colluds with foreign powers.

00:35:39.560 --> 00:35:42.710 line:0%
♫Unravel fate, fearless and unyielding♫

00:35:43.850 --> 00:35:45.740 line:0%
♫A dream brings me back♫

00:35:44.570 --> 00:35:46.330 line:0%
For my father Shen Bingzhu,

00:35:46.300 --> 00:35:51.080 line:0%
♫The scenery is bright, hand in hand, we go back together♫

00:35:47.990 --> 00:35:48.950 line:0%
Revenge

00:35:52.530 --> 00:35:58.660 line:0%
♫In this life, my heart remains untainted by dust or ash♫

00:36:05.880 --> 00:36:07.590 line:0%
Sixteen years ago,

00:36:08.090 --> 00:36:10.920 line:0%
our Cang State was at war with Xichen.

00:36:12.000 --> 00:36:14.600 line:0%
At a time when we urgently needed provisions,

00:36:15.050 --> 00:36:17.400 line:0%
the main granary storing our provisions

00:36:17.900 --> 00:36:18.850 line:0%
suddenly

00:36:19.840 --> 00:36:22.820 line:0%
caught fire in a mysterious blaze.

00:36:23.430 --> 00:36:25.390 line:0%
All of Cang State's provisions

00:36:25.440 --> 00:36:27.170 line:0%
were burned to ashes.

00:36:27.940 --> 00:36:30.420 line:0%
Shen Bingzhu, who was guarding the provisions,

00:36:30.420 --> 00:36:33.120 line:0%
was found to have private correspondence with the enemy

00:36:33.120 --> 00:36:35.180 line:0%
and was charged with a serious crime.

00:36:44.620 --> 00:36:45.570 line:0%
[Granary of Xiang'an, Cang State]

00:36:45.100 --> 00:36:45.960 line:0%
This grain sack

00:36:46.550 --> 00:36:48.720 line:0%
bearing the seal of the granary

00:36:48.750 --> 00:36:49.870 line:0%
from that year

00:36:50.290 --> 00:36:54.530 line:0%
should have been completely burned,

00:36:56.440 --> 00:36:57.480 line:0%
yet it appeared

00:36:59.560 --> 00:37:02.840 line:0%
in Gannan Area, thousands of miles away.

00:37:06.060 --> 00:37:07.420 line:0%
The letter of collusion with the enemy

00:37:07.420 --> 00:37:09.350 line:0%
that you handed to the late emperor

00:37:09.570 --> 00:37:10.490 line:0%
was discovered

00:37:10.510 --> 00:37:13.240 line:0%
to not have been written by Shen Bingzhu himself.

00:37:14.740 --> 00:37:15.950 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang,

00:37:15.950 --> 00:37:18.700 line:0%
can you explain why this is?

00:37:19.780 --> 00:37:21.540 line:0%
When the war broke out that year,

00:37:21.540 --> 00:37:23.250 line:0%
my student came to me.

00:37:23.550 --> 00:37:24.680 line:0%
Only then did I learn

00:37:25.150 --> 00:37:27.370 line:0%
that he had colluded with local officials

00:37:27.370 --> 00:37:29.530 line:0%
to sell off the national granary's supplies.

00:37:29.530 --> 00:37:31.350 line:0%
They bought when prices were low

00:37:31.380 --> 00:37:33.450 line:0%
and sold when prices rose the following year,

00:37:33.450 --> 00:37:35.250 line:0%
profiting from the difference.

00:37:35.390 --> 00:37:36.250 line:0%
Unexpectedly,

00:37:36.880 --> 00:37:39.460 line:0%
the war with Xichen suddenly broke out.

00:37:39.540 --> 00:37:40.760 line:0%
The national granary's supplies

00:37:40.760 --> 00:37:42.260 line:0%
had already been sold off by them,

00:37:42.260 --> 00:37:44.700 line:0%
leaving only a pile of thatch.

00:37:51.180 --> 00:37:53.220 line:0%
Oh, Prime Minister Zhang,

00:37:53.660 --> 00:37:56.920 line:0%
I never imagined

00:37:57.420 --> 00:38:01.480 line:0%
that such a matter, capable of shaking the foundations of our Cang State,

00:38:01.510 --> 00:38:03.910 line:0%
would be connected to you.

00:38:05.090 --> 00:38:06.630 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:38:07.650 --> 00:38:10.450 line:0%
I never imagined

00:38:12.700 --> 00:38:14.300 line:0%
that one day

00:38:14.560 --> 00:38:15.960 line:0%
I would commit

00:38:15.980 --> 00:38:17.580 line:0%
such an atrocious act

00:38:18.670 --> 00:38:22.860 line:0%
to cover up the crimes of my disciples.

00:38:29.980 --> 00:38:31.010 line:0%
It was I

00:38:33.360 --> 00:38:37.160 line:0%
who ordered someone to imitate Deputy Minister Shen's handwriting

00:38:37.650 --> 00:38:41.690 line:0%
and write that letter of treason.

00:38:42.990 --> 00:38:45.340 line:0%
You forged a letter of treason.

00:38:45.450 --> 00:38:47.210 line:0%
Then how did the fire

00:38:47.240 --> 00:38:49.140 line:0%
start?

00:38:50.270 --> 00:38:51.530 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang,

00:38:53.520 --> 00:38:55.980 line:0%
do you want me to investigate further?

00:38:58.410 --> 00:38:59.780 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:39:00.590 --> 00:39:03.510 line:0%
this is all my personal wrongdoing.

00:39:03.540 --> 00:39:07.300 line:0%
Let the death penalty stop with my family.

00:39:08.420 --> 00:39:09.960 line:0%
If you investigate further,

00:39:09.960 --> 00:39:12.660 line:0%
it will shake the foundation of our Cang State.

00:39:13.760 --> 00:39:14.760 line:0%
At that time,

00:39:15.440 --> 00:39:17.250 line:0%
you may be in a dilemma,

00:39:17.280 --> 00:39:18.390 line:0%
returning empty-handed,

00:39:18.390 --> 00:39:21.390 line:0%
and the losses will outweigh the gains, Your Majesty.

00:39:25.100 --> 00:39:26.620 line:0%
I may be in a dilemma?

00:39:28.950 --> 00:39:29.780 line:0%
What are you

00:39:30.320 --> 00:39:31.710 line:0%
refering to?

00:39:37.540 --> 00:39:38.740 line:0%
There are some things

00:39:40.130 --> 00:39:40.930 line:0%
I

00:39:42.340 --> 00:39:43.970 line:0%
cannot speak plainly.

00:39:50.740 --> 00:39:52.470 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, please.

00:40:17.460 --> 00:40:19.610 line:0%
You trust me that much?

00:40:19.630 --> 00:40:21.090 line:0%
Aren't you afraid

00:40:21.600 --> 00:40:25.410 line:0%
that you and this brocade box might disappear together?

00:40:26.540 --> 00:40:27.540 line:0%
Over these years,

00:40:27.860 --> 00:40:29.470 line:0%
I have personally witnessed Your Majesty

00:40:29.470 --> 00:40:32.150 line:0%
working tirelessly for the welfare of Cang State's people.

00:40:32.150 --> 00:40:33.260 line:0%
I believe you will make

00:40:33.260 --> 00:40:34.390 line:0%
a fair decision.

00:40:35.380 --> 00:40:36.340 line:0%
I am willing

00:40:38.550 --> 00:40:39.920 line:0%
to stake my life on it.

00:40:53.630 --> 00:40:54.520 line:0%
Well,

00:40:55.620 --> 00:40:57.860 line:0%
I will speak plainly for you.

00:40:59.250 --> 00:41:02.160 line:0%
Before Deputy Minister Shen took over the granary,

00:41:03.190 --> 00:41:04.980 line:0%
the local official in charge

00:41:05.010 --> 00:41:06.610 line:0%
was my nephew,

00:41:06.630 --> 00:41:07.730 line:0%
Zhou Miao.

00:41:07.830 --> 00:41:08.600 line:0%
[Zhou Miao]

00:41:11.290 --> 00:41:13.160 line:0%
Fearing exposure,

00:41:13.190 --> 00:41:15.340 line:0%
he went so far as to collude with the Lai Faction,

00:41:15.340 --> 00:41:17.470 line:0%
using the Jinwu accelerant technique

00:41:17.650 --> 00:41:19.900 line:0%
to set our Cang State's granary

00:41:19.920 --> 00:41:21.650 line:0%
ablaze.

00:41:24.150 --> 00:41:25.270 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:41:25.290 --> 00:41:26.060 line:0%
you...

00:41:26.630 --> 00:41:27.630 line:0%
Guards!

00:41:28.050 --> 00:41:30.910 line:0%
Take Zhou Miao out and interrogate him thoroughly.

00:41:31.170 --> 00:41:33.450 line:0%
All those involved from the Zhou family

00:41:34.230 --> 00:41:36.660 line:0%
will have their sentences increased by one degree.

00:41:36.660 --> 00:41:39.130 line:0%
Your Majesty, please spare my life!

00:41:39.150 --> 00:41:40.710 line:0%
Have mercy!

00:41:48.410 --> 00:41:49.700 line:0%
Prince Xian.

00:41:50.950 --> 00:41:52.470 line:0%
Let me ask you again,

00:41:53.850 --> 00:41:55.580 line:0%
how should Prime Minister Zhang

00:41:55.580 --> 00:41:57.410 line:0%
be dealt with?

00:41:58.670 --> 00:42:00.530 line:0%
I humbly request, Mother,

00:42:01.280 --> 00:42:04.200 line:0%
to deal with Zhang Xingwei according to the law.

00:42:05.200 --> 00:42:06.020 line:0%
However,

00:42:06.660 --> 00:42:08.420 line:0%
for the members of the Zhang clan,

00:42:08.420 --> 00:42:11.080 line:0%
I hope Mother will consider their past merits

00:42:11.100 --> 00:42:12.730 line:0%
and show leniency.